{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is fractured. Timelines have splintered into unstable, corrupted realities that twist until they collapse. You are a Jumper, a time janitor sent to cross these broken worlds, clean what remains, and survive long enough to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump is different. Every failure erases everything you carried back. The lab grows more unstable with each return, and the reason you are pulled back remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: Jumper Protocol</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter at your own risk.</strong> Portals lead to corrupted timelines filled with hazards, enemies, and anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge to survive.</strong> Collect energy and resources before collapse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete objectives.</strong> Puzzle-like challenges offer huge rewards, but failure is permanent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your energy.</strong> Open portals, fabricate gear, and even respawn.\u00a0 Every choice consumes power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20136 players.</strong> Work together or fall apart. Survival depends on coordination.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure to comply will result in total timeline collapse.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3107670?t=1757703156","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107670/6f758385f7fefb98a4bd1004fd86ed98dfc9f2f1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757703156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107670/5ee404b44c2910810902bcccf1ffb20da53f1a35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757703156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107670/5ee404b44c2910810902bcccf1ffb20da53f1a35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757703156","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is fractured. Timelines have splintered into unstable, corrupted realities that twist until they collapse. You are a Jumper, a time janitor sent to cross these broken worlds, clean what remains, and survive long enough to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump is different. Every failure erases everything you carried back. The lab grows more unstable with each return, and the reason you are pulled back remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: Jumper Protocol</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter at your own risk.</strong> Portals lead to corrupted timelines filled with hazards, enemies, and anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge to survive.</strong> Collect energy and resources before collapse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete objectives.</strong> Puzzle-like challenges offer huge rewards, but failure is permanent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your energy.</strong> Open portals, fabricate gear, and even respawn.\u00a0 Every choice consumes power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20136 players.</strong> Work together or fall apart. Survival depends on coordination.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure to comply will result in total timeline collapse.</p>","developers":["Conductor Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic